{"unit_id":"goatbroai__web-background#card-zh","repo":"goatbroai/web-background","commit":"7cd751575f590c509c9c7545dbfd48d983aa3640","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**web-background**（DSH 网页端插件）：为 DeepSeek Harness 网页端设置自定义背景。它在“设置 → 通用”中添加背景控制，并通过主题服务让主画布和侧栏透出背景层。你可以选择无背景、纯色或本地图片，调整颜色和 0–100% 不透明度，移除图片或恢复默认；图片会压缩后保存在浏览器，设置可在刷新及多个标签页间保持。适合想个性化网页外观、使用自选壁纸的 DSH 用户。无需 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:256-298","src/client/index.ts:331-414","src/client/index.ts:493-509"]}
{"unit_id":"goatbroai__web-background#card-en","repo":"goatbroai/web-background","commit":"7cd751575f590c509c9c7545dbfd48d983aa3640","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**web-background** customizes the DSH web backdrop. In Settings → General, choose no background, a color, or a local image; adjust opacity or reset. Images are compressed, settings saved in browser storage, and changes synchronized across tabs. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:256-298","src/client/index.ts:331-414","src/client/index.ts:493-509"]}
