{"unit_id":"goatbroai__web-background#readme-5","repo":"goatbroai/web-background","commit":"7cd751575f590c509c9c7545dbfd48d983aa3640","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"web-background README · 或本地目录：cd /path/to/web-background\npnpm install\npnpm run bundle\ndsh plugin --profile web add .\n```\n\n如果本地 `dsh plugin add` 报 `ERR_PNPM_ADDING_TO_ROOT`，加 `-w`：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add -w .\n```\n\n如果本机没有全局 `dsh`，也可以用 `npx` 运行：\n\n```sh\nnpx @deepseek-ai/dsh plugin --profile web add -w .\nnpx @deepseek-ai/dsh web\n```\n\n重启 web 生效。","source":"extracted","section":"或本地目录"}
